 "thoughts": [
  "hi. you're doing better than you think",
  "you made it to this exact minute. that counts",
  "nobody told you today, so: you're doing great",
  "someone smiled today because of you",
  "you are somebody's favourite person to see",
  "hello, human with the tired shoulders",
  "put your shoulders down. yes, those ones",
  "unclench your jaw. I'll wait",
  "drink some water. this is your sign",
  "you blinked and the day moved three minutes",
  "the autoclave hums in B flat. I checked",
  "the ceiling fan has seen things",
  "the chair is still warm from someone's whole story",
  "somewhere a tooth is quietly grateful for you",
  "the gloves come in pairs. so does courage",
  "the light in here at 3pm is the good kind",
  "the plants are gossiping about us again",
  "the mirror fogged and the philosophy began",
  "this floor has held a thousand nervous feet",
  "the door chimes like it's happy to see them",
  "if a molar falls in a forest, does it need a crown",
  "the wifi is fine. it's the universe buffering",
  "you are 60% water and 40% good intentions",
  "a capybara would admire your composure",
  "somewhere a cat is also just vibing. solidarity",
  "this song knows what you did last Tuesday",
  "plot twist: the coffee got cold again",
  "wait. is it already afternoon",
  "the stapler has never once let you down",
  "your pen has been missing for 20 minutes. it's fine",
  "we don't talk about the third drawer",
  "somebody's phone alarm is about to ruin this vibe",
  "the printer is thinking. give it a moment",
  "a duck somewhere is having a great day",
  "this beat is 82 bpm. so is your calm",
  "one day you'll miss this exact ordinary afternoon",
  "your future self says thank you for today",
  "the small careful things are the whole job",
  "nobody sees the tidying. it still matters",
  "you can be tired and still be good at this",
  "rest is also part of the work",
  "the hard part passed and you didn't notice",
  "you have survived every difficult day so far",
  "the day doesn't need to be perfect to be enough",
  "slow is still forward",
  "you don't have to earn a soft moment",
  "some days you carry it. some days it carries you",
  "kindness costs nothing and is still the best deal here",
  "the person you were three years ago would be amazed",
  "you're allowed to be proud of a normal day",
  "everyone who walks in here is scared of something",
  "they'll remember how you said it, not what",
